            "template": "Find inverse of [[{a}, {b}], [{c}, {d}]]",
            "note": "If det ≠ 0, use A⁻¹ = (1/det)·adj(A)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "systemsOfEquations": {
      "title": "Systems of Equations (Advanced)",
      "description": "Solving systems with 3+ variables or nonlinear systems",
      "concepts": [
        {
          "name": "3×3 Linear Systems",
          "explanation": "Solving systems of three linear equations with three unknowns using elimination or Gaussian elimination",
          "examples": [
            {
              "problem": "Solve: \\(x + y + z = 6\\), \\(2x - y + z = 3\\), \\(x + y - z = 0\\)",
              "solution": "\\(x = 1, y = 2, z = 3\\)",
              "steps": [
                "Label the equations: (1) \\(x + y + z = 6\\), (2) \\(2x - y + z = 3\\), (3) \\(x + y - z = 0\\)",
                "Add (1) + (3): \\(2x + 2y = 6 \\Rightarrow x + y = 3\\) ... (4)",
                "Subtract (2) - (3): \\(x - 2z = 3\\) ... (5)",
                "From (4): \\(y = 3 - x\\)",
                "Add (1) + (2): \\(3x + 2z = 9\\) ... (6)",
                "From (5) and (6): solve for x and z",
                "\\(x = 1, z = 3\\), then \\(y = 2\\)"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Nonlinear Systems",
          "explanation": "Systems containing quadratic or higher-degree equations",
          "examples": [
            {
              "problem": "Solve: \\(x^2 + y^2 = 25\\), \\(x + y = 7\\)",
              "solution": "\\((3, 4)\\) and \\((4, 3)\\)",
              "steps": [
                "From the linear equation: \\(y = 7 - x\\)",
                "Substitute into the circle equation: \\(x^2 + (7 - x)^2 = 25\\)",
                "\\(x^2 + 49 - 14x + x^2 = 25\\)",
                "\\(2x^2 - 14x + 24 = 0\\)",
                "\\(x^2 - 7x + 12 = 0\\)",
                "Factor: \\((x - 3)(x - 4) = 0\\)",
                "\\(x = 3\\) or \\(x = 4\\)",
                "If \\(x = 3\\): \\(y = 4\\); if \\(x = 4\\): \\(y = 3\\)",
                "Solutions: \\((3, 4)\\) and \\((4, 3)\\)"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "problemGenerator": {
